  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nNumber = 99980001\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a − b)² = a² − 2ab + b²\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ 99980001 = (10000 − 1)²\n\n⇒ (10000 − 1)² = 10000² − 2 × 10000 × 1 + 1\n\n⇒ = 100000000 − 20000 + 1\n\n⇒ = 99980001\n\n⇒ Square root = 10000 − 1 = 9999\n\n**∴ √99980001 = 9999**",
